hazelux (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Add credits About screen (Adw.AboutWindow) with publisher logo,
    lead developer, publisher, and GPL-3.0-or-later license.
  * Use the real application icon in the system tray instead of a
    placeholder drawing.
  * Hide to the system tray on window close when a tray icon is
    available; close really closes when no tray exists, and the first
    hide shows a hint toast.

